Package: integralARB
Title: Arbitrary-precise Numerical Integration using ARB Library
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Bao Khue", "Tran", email = "khuebtran03@gmail.com", role = c("cre", "aut")),
    person("FLINT Contributors", role = "cph", comment = "Uses FLINT library"))
Description: Performs rigorous numerical integration for common functions using ball arithmetic with mathematically guaranteed error bounds. Based on the FLINT/ARB library.
License: LGPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://github.com/tranbaokhue/integralARB
BugReports: https://github.com/tranbaokhue/integralARB/issues
SystemRequirements: FLINT library (>= 3.0.0) with ACB support, GMP, MPFR. On Ubuntu <=20.04, FLINT must be built from source. See README for installation instructions.
